WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:01.760
General Zhu

00:01.840 --> 00:03.480
Like this bow and arrow

00:03.560 --> 00:04.880
I only need him

00:04.960 --> 00:06.360
To be peerlessly sharp

00:11.040 --> 00:12.440
This arrow

00:12.840 --> 00:15.507
If it can shoot down the Wuzhao sun

00:15.680 --> 00:16.760
I

00:16.840 --> 00:18.240
Can tolerate anything

00:18.760 --> 00:19.960
Let General Zhu

00:20.040 --> 00:21.440
Continue leading troops

